<meta type=article>
  <title | Code cross-reference test fixture>
  <author | Ariel Balter>
</meta>

<section | Code blocks with cross-references>

A code-block sigil with a colon-id:

<``` python #code:hello | def hello():
    print("hello") ```>

A code-block sigil with no id (not referenceable, no colon):

<``` python | x = 1 + 2 ```>

<section | References to code blocks>

Reference to labeled code block (resolves to label-tail "hello"): see <ref @code:hello>.

Reference to missing code label (produces error): <ref @code:missing>.
